---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Community">
  <h1>Community</h1>
  <p>
    Outside the lab, I spend a lot of my time on mentoring and community
    work&mdash;it's just as much a part of who I am as the science is.
  </p>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Food Not Bombs</h3>
    <p class="pub-meta">September 2024 &ndash; Present</p>
    <p>
      I volunteer weekly with Food Not Bombs East Bay, helping serve 25&ndash;40
      meals a week to our community. It's become one of the most grounding
      parts of my week, and a direct way to put my belief in mutual aid
      into practice.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Adventure Challenge Volunteer</h3>
    <p class="pub-meta">September 2018 &ndash; December 2019</p>
    <p>
      I was paired with a 13-year-old girl with autism through the
      Adventure Challenge program, planning weekly trips to the YMCA pool
      for swimming and pool games. The goal was simple but meaningful:
      promote physical activity, social interaction, and overall health and
      wellness to help her maintain a healthy, active lifestyle.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Advancement Via Individual Determination (AVID) Tutor</h3>
    <p class="pub-meta">September 2018 &ndash; December 2018</p>
    <p>
      As an AVID tutor, I served as a discussion mediator during highly
      interactive tutoring sessions, helping students learn to guide each
      other toward solutions through questions and critical thinking rather
      than direct answers. The goal was to help students build effective,
      long-term study habits and the intellectual confidence to pursue and
      succeed in higher education after graduating high school.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
